WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.360
Se ha ido.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.640
My condolences.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:45.600
I’ll stay here for a bit longer and...

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.280
then I’ll head back to the mansion.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:49.520
No, no, no.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:52.560
You listen to me. It's too dangerous.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.520
Stay in the hospital.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.600
What do you mean?

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.880
Listen, I'm not driving.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:59.600
Anthony will take me...

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.960
It’s not what I’m saying.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:01.440
Please,

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.040
spend the night in the hospital.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.840
I'm sure they have rooms for family.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:07.880
And I'll pick you up in the morning.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.080
In the morning?

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.400
Do you even understand

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.160
what just happened,

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:15.520
Mason?

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:19.880
Grandpa is dead.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:21.560
The only person who ever

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.640
wanted you in this family

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.120
is dead.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:28.120
Just have some dignity, Powell.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:32.920
I repaid him. And the family.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:36.880
But please stay in the hospital.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:37.840
I gotta go.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.680
I'll see you in the morning.
